WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
1 / Add heat • an intrusion heats its wall rock
New magma carries heat into cooler crust. Heat flows through the wall rock; a portion can melt.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
2 / Decompression • ridges and mantle plumes
The mantle parcel rises into lower pressure. Partial melt appears between solid grains without adding heat.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
3 / Add water • subduction-zone mantle wedge
Water leaves the descending slab and lowers the melting temperature of the mantle wedge. Magma then rises.
